# Cargo output, anywhere. Anchored at the root this read `/target` and
# missed crates/cyclops-ledger/target/, which is how 751 build files (113M)
# came to be tracked: the crate was built standalone before it joined the
# workspace, and a workspace member's output lands in the root target/ now.
target/
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
# Python bytecode, anywhere. Naming one directory left
# tests/__pycache__/m1_soak.cpython-313.pyc tracked, and a compiled
# artifact in the record shows up as a change in every milestone that
# happens to run the soak driver.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
/tests/raw/
*.ndjson.tmp
/.claude/
